        "timestamp": 1785603098
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>hm<br>\nbut do we want idk <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Subring.toSubsemiring#doc\">docs#Subring.toSubsemiring</a> to be bundled like that?<br>\nand if not how to we make the <code>simp</code> API of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=sInfHom#doc\">docs#sInfHom</a> fire?<br>\ndo we need automatic code generation? <span aria-label=\"thinking\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f914\" role=\"img\" title=\"thinking\">:thinking:</span></p>",
