        "sender_full_name": "Artie Khovanov",
        "timestamp": 1785603148
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>the definition of <code>sInfHom</code> seems a bit weird, it's also asking to preserve any potential junk values of <code>sInf</code>?</p>",
